msgid "About Taiga"
msgstr "Sobre Taiga"

msgid "She made a huge damn mess"
msgstr "Hizo un maldito desastre"

msgid "She was talking about self-reliance"
msgstr "Estaba hablando de ser independiente"

msgid "She barely sent out any New Year's cards"
msgstr "Casi no envió tarjetas de Año Nuevo"

msgid "About Kushieda"
msgstr "Sobre Kushieda"

msgid "Frankly, she's pretty cute"
msgstr "La verdad, es bastante linda"

msgid "She gets worked up over Taiga"
msgstr "Se altera mucho por Taiga"

msgid "She worked all through New Year's"
msgstr "Trabajó durante todo Año Nuevo"

msgid "About the Trio"
msgstr "Sobre el trío"

msgid "Their names all start with \"K\""
msgstr "Todos sus nombres empiezan con \"K\""

msgid "They're all pretty"
msgstr "Todas son preciosas"

msgid "Seems they all get along great"
msgstr "Parece que todas se llevan muy bien"

msgid "About Memories"
msgstr "Sobre los recuerdos"

msgid "Can't I remember everything at once?"
msgstr "¿No puedo recordarlo todo de una vez?"

msgid "Is it true birds have a 3 second memory?"
msgstr "¿Las aves tienen 3 segundos de memoria?"

msgid "Seriously, where did the memories go?"
msgstr "En serio, ¿adónde fueron los recuerdos?"

msgid "About Cooking"
msgstr "Sobre la cocina"

msgid "I enjoy making things"
msgstr "Disfruto hacer cosas"

msgid "Seems I'm finally back to my usual self"
msgstr "Parece que ya volví a ser el de antes"

msgid "I'll get fat if I keep cooking up feasts"
msgstr "Engordaré si sigo haciendo banquetes"

msgid "--Let's Try Chatting with Inko-chan!--"
msgstr "--¡Intentemos charlar con Inko-chan!--"

msgid "Inko-chan「YOU, JELLY......」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¿TÚ, MELOSO......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hm? I'm not really jealous.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Mm? La verdad no estoy celoso.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「......」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm not making toast either......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tampoco preparo pan con miel......」"

msgid "Inko-chan「FREE, FREEZE!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡QUI, QUIETO!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Inko-chan「HWAAA! KYAAA!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡JUAAA! ¡KYAAA!」"

msgid "Inko-chan「BZZT」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「BZZT」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hmm? \"Bzzt\"?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Mmm? ¿\"Bzzt\"?」"

msgid "Inko-chan「GIVE UP」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「ME RINDO」"

msgid "Inko-chan「THAT'S GOOD!!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡¡ESO ESTÁ BIEN!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh? That was quite straightforward of＿you. Haha.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Oh? Eso fue bastante directo＿de tu parte. Jaja.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「ME, ME...... MEZ?」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¿DE, DE...... DESA?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「A damn mess. M-E-S-S.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Un maldito desastre. D-E-S-A-S-T-R-E.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「DA, DAM, DAMN......」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「MA, MAL, MALDITO......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「STOP! No no no, Inko-chan! You can't＿learn that word!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡ALTO! ¡No, no, no, Inko-chan! ¡No＿puedes aprender esa palabra!」"

msgid "Inko-chan「DE」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「DE」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, \"de\" isn't much to go off of.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, \"de\" no me dice mucho.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「MO」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「MO」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Neither is \"mo\"...... *Gasp*! Did you mean＿\"demo\"......? Yeah, right. Sorry,＿Inko-chan.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Con \"mo\" tampoco...... ¡Ah! ¿Quisiste＿decir \"demo\"......? Sí, claro.＿Perdón, Inko-chan.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「CARDS」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「TARJETAS」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, she said she got a lot...... She was＿probably happy about it in her own＿way, but it kinda makes you think.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, dijo que recibió muchas...... Seguro＿estaba contenta a su manera, pero da＿un poco en qué pensar.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「RIGHT」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「CIERTO」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see. Guess you understand me,＿Inko-chan.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo. Supongo que me＿entiendes, Inko-chan.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「CU, UTE!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡LI, INDA!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, you agree? I see...... Wait, has she＿been to our house before?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Ah, sí? Ya veo...... Espera, ¿ella＿ha venido a nuestra casa antes?」"

msgid "Inko-chan「GOOD! GOOD!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡BIEN! ¡BIEN!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Don't tell me, you thought I meant＿y...... I mean, of course you're super＿cute too! Of course, of course!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No me digas que creíste que＿hablaba de t...... ¡O sea, claro que tú＿también eres muy lindo! ¡Claro, claro!」"

msgid "Inko-chan「CU, CU......TE?」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¿LI, LIN...... DO?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's weird that you need confirmation＿on that...... Wait, why am I letting myself＿get embarrassed!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Es raro que necesites confirmación＿de eso...... Espera, ¡¿por qué dejo＿que me dé vergüenza?!」"

msgid "Inko-chan「CUTE!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡LINDO!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......D-Do you mean me......? Yeah, right.＿Sorry, Inko-chan. It's my fault. I'm＿sorry, okay......? *Sigh*～」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿T-Te refieres a mí......? Sí,＿claro. Perdón, Inko-chan. Es mi culpa.＿Lo siento, ¿sí......? *Suspiro*～」"

msgid "Inko-chan「DUNNO」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「NO SÉ」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha......? Why are you being so defiant,＿Inko-chan? Don't tell me you're＿jealous! Are you?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué......? ¿Por qué te pones tan＿desafiante, Inko-chan? ¡No me digas＿que estás celoso! ¿Lo estás?」"

msgid "Inko-chan「DUNNO」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「NO SÉ」"

msgid "Inko-chan「YA, YAT, YATCHO......」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡YA, YAT, YATCHÚ......!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Gotta sneeze?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Vas a estornudar?」"

msgid "Inko-chan「YA, YACCHA」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「YA, YACCHA」"

msgid "Inko-chan「K!!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡¡K!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Right. The letter after J and before L.＿Kawashima, Kashii and Kihara all start＿with K.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Exacto. La letra entre la J y＿la L. Kawashima, Kashii y Kihara＿empiezan todas con K.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「CAW! CAW!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡CRAA! ¡CRAA!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Wait, Inko-chan! You're not a crow!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¡Para, Inko-chan! ¡No eres cuervo!」"

msgid "Inko-chan「K?」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¿K?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Right. The letter after J and before L.＿Kawashima, Kashii and Kihara all start＿with K.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Exacto. La letra entre la J y＿la L. Kawashima, Kashii y Kihara＿empiezan todas con K.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「KU?」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¿KU?」"

msgid "Inko-chan「GOOD! PRE, PRETTY!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡BIEN! ¡PRE, PRECIOSAS!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh, yeah. It never hurts to be pretty,＿I guess.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A-Ah, sí. Nunca está de más＿ser preciosa, supongo.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「YAAAAY!!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡¡BIEEEEEN!!」"

msgid "Inko-chan「......PRE......? HEAT?」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「......¿PRE......? ¿CALENTAR?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, we're talking about girls, not ovens.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, hablamos de chicas, no de hornos.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「O RLY」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「EN CRIO」"

msgid "Inko-chan「AT NUNS!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡DE UNA NUEZ!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「*Sigh*...... Oh well, it's silly to worry over＿it...... Nice try, Inko-chan. It's \"at ONCE,\"＿got it? Give it another try.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「*Suspiro*...... Qué tonto preocuparse＿por eso...... Buen intento, Inko-chan.＿Es \"de una VEZ\", ¿sí? Intenta otra vez.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「AT UNCLE!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡DE UNA RES!」"

msgid "Inko-chan「FRET?」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¿ESTRESAR?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hmmm, nice try. But it's less fretting＿and more depressing.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mmmm, buen intento. Pero no es tanto＿estrés, sino más bien depresión.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「DEPRESS?」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¿DEPRIMIR?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh, you got it. Sorry, Inko-chan. I've＿gotten into the habit of correcting you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ah, acertaste. Perdón, Inko-chan.＿Ya tomé la costumbre de corregirte.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「STOP...... LOOOOOK! DOOOOWN!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡PARA...... MIIIIRA! ¡ABAAAJO!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh, are you perhaps trying to say＿not to look down on you? Sorry,＿Inko-chan!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A-Ah, ¿acaso intentas decir que＿no te mire por encima del hombro?＿¡Perdón, Inko-chan!」"

msgid "Inko-chan「RAMEEEEN!!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡¡RAMEEEEN!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I said I'm sorry!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡D-Dije que lo siento!」"

msgid "Inko-chan「DON'T, FRET」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「NO TE, ESTRESES」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, if you say it like that, I'll really start＿to think they ended up in your head,＿Inko-chan. And that's insane.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, si lo dices así, de verdad voy a＿pensar que terminaron en tu cabeza,＿Inko-chan. Y eso es una locura.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「!@#$%^&*」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「!@#$%^&*」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, that's insane, all right.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, eso sí que es una locura.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「JOY! JOY!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡DISFRUTE! ¡DISFRUTE!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh! I'm so happy you understand me,＿Inko-chan.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ah! Qué feliz me pone que＿me entiendas, Inko-chan.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「TOY TOY! TOY!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡JUGUETE, JUGUETE! ¡JUGUETE!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......To be clear, I don't enjoy making＿toys.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Para aclarar, no disfruto＿hacer juguetes.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「MA, KING?」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¿HA, HACER?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah. Although, more than anything, I＿enjoy the happy looks on their faces＿as they gobble up my food. It's great.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí. Aunque, más que nada, disfruto＿ver sus caras felices mientras devoran＿mi comida. Es genial.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「GREAT!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡GENIAL!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, you understand me, Inko-chan?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oh, ¿me entiendes, Inko-chan?」"

msgid "Inko-chan「FINE...... FINALLY? EEEEEEKK!!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「BIEN...... ¿POR FIN? ¡¡AAAAAH!!」"

msgid "Inko-chan「......FEE?」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「......¿BAN?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's right, FEAST.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Así es, BANQUETE.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「......STILL? NOT......」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「......¿SIGUEN? NO......」"

