msgid "Ryuuji「W-What? Freeze......? Is this a stickup?＿Why are you mugging me,＿Inko-chan......? Aww, it's no use. I'm just」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Q-Qué? ¿Quieto......? ¿Es un asalto?＿¿Por qué me asaltas, Inko-chan......?＿Ay, es inútil. Solo te estoy」"

msgid "Ryuuji「confusing you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「confundiendo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Is this some kind of staring contest?＿What do you mean \"give up,\"＿Inko-chan? Hey, don't ignore me......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Esto es una competencia de miradas?＿¿A qué te refieres con \"me rindo\",＿Inko-chan? Oye, no me ignores......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Jeez, that's my line......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Caray, esa es mi frase......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Danno? No, \"dino\"? I know, you're＿saying \"down\"! In other words, you're＿trying to say \"calm down.\" You got it,」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿No ves? No, ¿\"no estés\"? ¡Ya sé,＿dices \"no te estreses\"! O sea, quieres＿decir \"cálmate\". Entendido,」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Inko-chan. Thanks.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Inko-chan. Gracias.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh, you mean Yasuko!? You're right.＿Yasuko worked all through New Year's,＿too! You're so thoughtful, Inko-chan!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¡¿Ah, te refieres a Yasuko?! Es＿verdad. ¡Yasuko también trabajó todo Año＿Nuevo! ¡Qué atento eres, Inko-chan!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm madly impressed!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Estoy súper impresionado!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh, Kushieda does too...... and so＿does Kitamura. There's a lot of K＿names for some reason...... Well, I guess」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ah, Kushieda también...... y＿Kitamura igual. Hay muchos nombres con＿K por alguna razón...... Bueno, supongo」"

msgid "Ryuuji「five isn't a lot...... Wait, who cares?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「que cinco son pocos...... ¿Y qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh......? Did you just say \"oh really\"......?＿Jeez, my heart skipped a couple＿beats...... No, must've just been my」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh......? ¿Dijiste \"en serio\"......?＿Vaya, me dio un vuelco el corazón......＿No, debió de ser mi」"

msgid "Ryuuji「imagination, yeah.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「imaginación, sí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Mm, not quite right. Wait, why do you＿look so happy, Inko-chan......? Because I＿stopped worrying? You really are」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mm, no exactamente. Espera, ¿por qué＿estás tan feliz, Inko-chan......?＿¿Porque ya no me preocupo? ¡Sí que eres」"

msgid "Ryuuji「thoughtful, Inko-chan!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「muy atento, Inko-chan!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Did you think I meant \"finally going＿to eat you\"? Is it taboo to discuss＿cooking with you......? Argh, it's no use.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Pensaste que quise decir \"por fin＿te voy a comer\"? ¿Es tabú hablar de＿cocina contigo......? Ay, es inútil.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're not listening at all.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No estás escuchando para nada.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......In short, you're asking whether the＿feasts are still happening or not......＿right? That's quite a mouthful,」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......En resumen, preguntas si siguen＿los banquetes o no...... ¿verdad?＿Qué frase tan larga,」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Inko-chan.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Inko-chan.」"
